  "title": "4 Days Simien Mountain Wildlife Safari",
  "slug": "4-days-simien-mountain-wildlife-safari",
  "description": "<p>Experience the breathtaking Simien Mountains on a 4-day adventure. Fly from <strong>Addis Ababa</strong> to <strong>Gondar,</strong> drive to Sankaber, and meet the unique <strong>Gelada baboons.</strong> Explore Gich, spotting the rare <strong>Walia ibex</strong> and <strong>Jinbar Waterfall,</strong> then trek to Chennek and climb <strong>Ras Dashen,</strong> Ethiopia\u2019s highest peak. Return to Gondar and visit the historic <strong>Fasil Ghebbi.</strong></p><p></p><p>Price Includes:</p><ul><li><p>Simien Mountain Hikes</p></li><li><p>4 days accommodation with breakfast</p></li><li><p>4x4 Toyota Land Cruiser jeep with fuel and driver's</p></li><li><p>Park fees</p></li><li><p>Entrance fees</p></li><li><p>Scout fees</p></li><li><p>Local guide fees and other associated expenses</p></li><li><p>Nature professional guide</p></li><li><p>Photography and video fees</p></li><li><p>Hotel or airport pickup and drop off</p></li><li><p>Unlimited bottles of water</p></li><li><p>Government tax</p></li><li><p>Ethiopian coffee or tea</p></li><li><p>4 days Simien Mountain full meal board</p></li><li><p>Farewell dinner</p></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Price excludes:</p><ul><li><p>&nbsp;Personal tips</p></li><li><p>&nbsp;Alcoholic drinks</p></li><li><p>&nbsp;Domestics flight</p></li></ul>",
